{"words": [{"text": "وَلِكُلٍّۢ", "translation": "And for all"}, {"text": "دَرَجَـٰتٌۭ", "translation": "(will be) degrees"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "عَمِلُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "they did"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "رَبُّكَ", "translation": "(is) your Lord"}, {"text": "بِغَـٰفِلٍ", "translation": "unaware"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "about what"}, {"text": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "they do"}], "sahih": "And for all are degrees [i.e., positions resulting] from what they have done. And your Lord is not unaware of what they do."}